d runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 37% of normal in November to December and 158% in May to June. For 2026 so far, March to April sits at 35% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 18195 had its driest year in 2016 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
